<navigation-bar title="{{mode==='RECIPE'?'收藏菜品':'饮食偏好'}}" back="{{false}}" color="#332724" background="transparent"><view slot="left" class="nav-back" catchtap="goBack">‹</view></navigation-bar>
<view wx:if="{{mode==='LIST'}}" class="page collection-list" bindtap="dismissConfirmation"><text wx:if="{{reviewLabel}}" class="review">{{reviewLabel}}</text><text class="title">{{babyName}}的收藏菜品</text><text class="note">收藏用于保存你感兴趣的菜品，不代表已吃过或已确认耐受。</text><text wx:if="{{loading}}" class="note">正在加载收藏…</text><view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" class="card"><text>{{errorMessage}}</text><button bindtap="load">重试</button></view><text wx:if="{{!loading && !errorMessage && !items.length}}" id="collections-empty" class="note">暂未收藏菜品，可在饮食推荐的图片旁点击星形图标收藏。</text>
<view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="dishFingerprint" id="collection-row-{{index}}" class="card collection-row" data-key="{{item.dishFingerprint}}" catchtap="openRecipe"><view id="collection-thumbnail-{{index}}" class="collection-thumbnail" data-key="{{item.dishFingerprint}}" catchtap="viewImage" role="button" aria-label="查看{{item.name}}收藏图片"><image wx:if="{{item.imagePath}}" src="{{item.imagePath}}" mode="aspectFill" class="collection-photo"/><text wx:else class="thumbnail-placeholder">{{item.imageFailed?'重试':item.imageRepairing?'补图中':'加载中'}}</text></view><view class="copy"><text class="name">{{item.name}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.imageMessage}}" class="note">{{item.imageMessage}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.recipe.description}}" class="note">{{item.recipe.description}}</text></view><view class="collection-action-slot"><view wx:if="{{confirming===item.dishFingerprint}}" class="remove-confirm"><view id="confirm-remove-{{index}}" class="confirm-choice confirm-yes" catchtap="confirmRemove" data-key="{{item.dishFingerprint}}" role="button" aria-label="确认取消收藏"><image class="confirm-choice-icon" src="/assets/collection-confirm-remove-v1.png" mode="aspectFit" aria-hidden="true"/></view><view id="keep-collection-{{index}}" class="confirm-choice confirm-keep" catchtap="keepRemove" role="button" aria-label="保留收藏"><image class="confirm-choice-icon" src="/assets/collection-keep-v1.png" mode="aspectFit" aria-hidden="true"/></view></view><view wx:else id="remove-collection-{{index}}" class="remove" catchtap="requestRemove" data-key="{{item.dishFingerprint}}" role="button" aria-label="取消收藏">{{busy===item.dishFingerprint?'保存中':'取消收藏'}}</view></view></view></view>
<view wx:else class="shell recipe-shell collection-detail"><text wx:if="{{reviewLabel}}" class="note">{{reviewLabel}} · 非实际喂养验收</text><view class="collection-detail-label"><view class="ai-menu-tag"><view class="ai-menu-sparkle" aria-hidden="true"/><text>AI精选</text></view></view><text wx:if="{{loading || detailLoading}}" class="note">正在加载菜品…</text><view wx:if="{{errorMessage}}" id="collection-detail-error" class="error">{{errorMessage}}<button bindtap="retryDetail">重试</button></view><block wx:if="{{recipe}}"><include src="../../templates/diet-recipe.wxml"/><view class="recipe-function-info"><view id="recipe-function-info-toggle" class="recipe-function-info-toggle" bindtap="toggleRecipeInfo" role="button" aria-expanded="{{showRecipeInfo}}"><text>功能说明</text><text>{{showRecipeInfo?'−':'+'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{showRecipeInfo}}" id="recipe-function-info-details"><text class="risk">这里展示收藏时保存的菜品内容与图片。备餐参考量和形态沿用原菜单，请结合宝宝当前能力与需避开食材核对。正常收藏图片保留原版本；图片缺失时使用同菜可用图，无可用图才沿用现有服务补图。</text><text class="risk">{{risk}}</text></view></view></block></view>
